# Route: guide 21 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 42 to 43, 48
# quests, 2.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ironforge, Darkshore, Ashenvale, Dustwallow Marsh, Loch Modan,
# Thousand Needles, Durotar): Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near
# Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Auberdine -> The Master's Glaive
# -> The Zoram Strand -> The Shrine of Aessina -> Theramore Isle -> Ironband's
# Excavation Site -> Stonesplinter Valley -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Save Techbot's Brain! (2922;
# Techbot 26); The Black Box (708; Zaricotl 55-56); The Star, the Hand and the
# Heart (735; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying
# 44); The Shattered Necklace (2198; Shadowforge Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge
# Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger 35-36, Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37,
# Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter 36-37); Shadowshard
# Fragments (7070; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher 41-42,
# Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Encrusted Tail Fins (1107; Saltscale Warrior
# 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37, Saltscale Forager
# 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen Battleguard
# 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 1578 Supplying
# the Front; 1618 Gearing Redridge; 3629 Goblin Engineering; 3632 Gnome
# Engineering; 3640 The Pledge of Secrecy; 3641 Show Your Work; 3647
# Membership Card Renewal; 5283 The Art of the Armorsmith; 5284 The Way of the
# Weaponsmith; 6609 I Got Nothin' Left!; 6612 I Know A Guy...; 6625 Alliance
# Trauma; 96045 Camping 101: Alchemy; 96059 Camping 101: Enchanting.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The
# Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
# of the Kingdom (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394),
# An Ancient Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms
# (96403), The Treaty of Understanding (98423), Blackfathom Villainy (1200),
# Tiara of the Deep (2846), The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770).

